Package: totaljs-wallpapers
Version: 1.0.0-2
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Total.js <repository@totaljs.com>
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.totaljs.com
Description: Wallpapers of the Total.js Developer Distros
 Thirteen wallpapers at 3840 x 2160 with the logo of Total.js: six in graphite and
 the green of the logo, three with colors that remind of Ubuntu and three of Arch.
 An optional wallpaper features Toto, mascot of Spanish Total.js.
 They are installed in /usr/share/backgrounds/totaljs.
